---
title: 'Lemon Tart'
description: 'A delicious lemon tart, using a shortcrust base written in another file and pulled in with @use.'
category: 'Dessert'
portions: 8
---

@use "./bases/shortcrust-base.gram" as &shortcrust

## Lemon Curd ->&curd

[Whisk] The @eggs{3}, @sugar{150 g}, and @lemon juice{120 ml}<@lemons{2} in a #saucepan over ^{low heat} until thickened, about ~{8min}. 

[Incorporate] Remove from heat, blend in the @butter{80 g}, and whisk in until glossy. 

## Baking and assembling

[Line] A #tart tin{}(24cm) with the &shortcrust{250 g}(rolled out thin).

[Bake] At ^{180C} for ~_{15min}. ->&baked shell{}

[Fill] The &baked shell{} with the &curd and ^{chill} for ~_{2h} before serving.
